meta {
  name: Sync Site Admin Templates
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/radiology-panels/sync
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "masterDataId": "{{masterDataId}}"
  }
}

docs {
  Re-pull previously-imported radiology panels from their SITE_ADMIN templates.
  Business JWT. Body: `masterDataId` (required) + optional `radiologyPanelIds`
  (subset, max 500 unique; omit to sync every imported panel in the master data).

  **Full overwrite:** each tenant copy's scalars are replaced from its template and
  its member tests are rebuilt from the template composition. Identity + provenance
  (`id`, `tenantId`, `branchId`, `masterDataId`, `source`, `clonedFromId`) are
  preserved, `versionHistory` is bumped and `templateSyncedAt` is stamped.
  Hand-created panels (`clonedFromId = null`) are never touched. Each panel syncs in
  its own transaction. Returns:

  `{ "synced":  [{radiologyPanelId,panelName,templateId}],
     "skipped": [{radiologyPanelId,panelName,templateId,reason}],  // template removed
     "failed":  [{radiologyPanelId,panelName,templateId,reason}] }`

  - `masterDataId` must belong to the caller's tenant → else 404
    `MASTER_DATA_NOT_FOUND`.
}
